# Tracked on purpose: the single published reference report pack and its guide.
# These negations must stay last so the extension rules above do not re-ignore
# the files inside the pack. See reports/README.md.
!reports/README.md
!reports/vidar.exe.pack/
!reports/vidar.exe.pack/**
reports/vidar.exe.pack.zip
